# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
.venv/
venv/
env/

# Generated waveforms (rig state, not source).
# waveforms/ is where the GUI's "save" writes and where the arb generator drops
# its output -- the CSVs here are 80-170 KB numeric dumps regenerated from a
# handful of parameters (frequency list, point count, phase seed), and half of
# them are scratch from a bench session (TEST_GUI, TEST_RAF). A .RAF is one step
# further downstream: the 14-bit DAC16 image of a CSV, in the instrument's own
# internal-memory format. Neither is anybody's source of truth, so both are
# treated the way the dock treats recordings/ -- keep the folder, ignore what
# lands in it. Anything that is genuinely a worked example belongs in README.md
# as the parameters that produce it, not as a megabyte of samples.
waveforms/*
!waveforms/.gitkeep
!waveforms/README.md
*.raf
*.RAF

